cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ORCA-MI in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ORCA-MI: Open Radiology & Computational Analysis - Molecular Imaging"
abstract: >-
  Quantitative molecular imaging workstation for Windows, built for nuclear
  medicine with full CT and MR support: DICOM and NIfTI viewing,
  manual and AI segmentation (nnU-Net, nnInteractive), PET/SPECT quantification,
  dynamic and multi-time-point analysis, dosimetry, registration, lesion tracking
  and DICOM export.
authors:
